{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Prohibeast \u2013 Stealth Tactics at the Heart of Prohibition</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Prohibeast</strong>, a real-time tactical infiltration game, dive into a <strong>1930s Chicago</strong> plagued by corruption and the smuggling of meat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As meat consumption is banned, <strong>Al Capone</strong> expands his criminal empire through a ruthless black market. In the face of widespread corruption, <strong>Eliot Ness</strong> and his team of <strong>Untouchables</strong> are ready to strike from the shadows to take down the underworld from within.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Infiltration &amp; Strategy: Define Your Own Style</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503790/extras/d6fcd1ef15a95072b94553098804e658.poster.avif?t=1773043697\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503790/extras/d6fcd1ef15a95072b94553098804e658.webm?t=1773043697\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503790/extras/d6fcd1ef15a95072b94553098804e658.mp4?t=1773043697\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every mission will test your strategic thinking and stealth skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c6 <strong>Plan Your Operations</strong> \u2013 Choose your approach: silent infiltration, discreet neutralization, or clever diversion.<br>\u25c6 <strong>Use the Environment</strong> \u2013 Hideouts, alternate paths, distractions\u2026 Each mission offers multiple solutions.<br>\u25c6 <strong>Outsmart the Enemies\u2019 Sharp Senses</strong> \u2013 Keen vision, acute hearing, heightened smell\u2026 Discover a <strong>new way to play</strong> where infiltration is no longer just about hiding!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Lead the Untouchables</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503790/extras/25b70d2445b9eecba85d0bda226ae647.poster.avif?t=1773043697\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503790/extras/25b70d2445b9eecba85d0bda226ae647.webm?t=1773043697\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503790/extras/25b70d2445b9eecba85d0bda226ae647.mp4?t=1773043697\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the leader of the <strong>Untouchables</strong>, take control of <strong>Eliot Ness</strong> and his team, a group of specialists with complementary skills\u2014each playing a crucial role in your infiltration missions:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c6 <strong>Eliot Ness</strong> \u2013 A bold and adaptable leader, capable of handling any situation to complete even the most dangerous missions.<br>\u25c6 <strong>Malone B. Clonan</strong> \u2013 A tough and loyal right-hand man, favoring a more direct and forceful approach.<br>\u25c6 <strong>Frank E. Eager</strong> \u2013 A methodical and discreet sniper, eliminating targets with deadly precision.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Additional specialists will join your team to refine your strategies.<br>Learn to <strong>leverage their strengths and weaknesses</strong> to craft unique strategies and catch the underworld off guard.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Infiltrate Iconic Locations</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503790/extras/6902bb5186c3aabdd1f383069e6f2a00.poster.avif?t=1773043697\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503790/extras/6902bb5186c3aabdd1f383069e6f2a00.webm?t=1773043697\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503790/extras/6902bb5186c3aabdd1f383069e6f2a00.mp4?t=1773043697\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each mission takes you deep into <strong>Chicago\u2019s most crime-ridden</strong> and corrupt hotspots.<br>Observe, plan, and adapt your approach to achieve your objectives <strong>without leaving a trace</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From <strong>The Loop</strong>, Chicago\u2019s iconic district and center of corrupt power, to the <strong>mayor\u2019s residence</strong>, where criminal alliances are forged, and the <strong>foggy docks of Lake Michigan</strong>, a key smuggling hub\u2014each location is filled with dangers and opportunities, requiring <strong>tailored approaches to survive</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But other criminal strongholds await, where even the slightest mistake could be fatal.<br>Only the most strategic players will <strong>infiltrate undetected</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you be able to operate in the shadows and bring down <strong>Al Capone\u2019s criminal empire</strong>?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3503790?t=1773043697","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503790/f22f851ea40e0c7a0ece8988775a80dd107b8d42/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773043697","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503790/1d0c9b897decdb4a833b64d5cce9407403326c53/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773043697","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503790/1d0c9b897decdb4a833b64d5cce9407403326c53/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773043697","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Prohibeast \u2013 Stealth Tactics at the Heart of Prohibition</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Prohibeast</strong>, a real-time tactical infiltration game, dive into a <strong>1930s Chicago</strong> plagued by corruption and the smuggling of meat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As meat consumption is banned, <strong>Al Capone</strong> expands his criminal empire through a ruthless black market. In the face of widespread corruption, <strong>Eliot Ness</strong> and his team of <strong>Untouchables</strong> are ready to strike from the shadows to take down the underworld from within.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Infiltration &amp; Strategy: Define Your Own Style</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503790/extras/d6fcd1ef15a95072b94553098804e658.poster.avif?t=1773043697\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503790/extras/d6fcd1ef15a95072b94553098804e658.webm?t=1773043697\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503790/extras/d6fcd1ef15a95072b94553098804e658.mp4?t=1773043697\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every mission will test your strategic thinking and stealth skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c6 <strong>Plan Your Operations</strong> \u2013 Choose your approach: silent infiltration, discreet neutralization, or clever diversion.<br>\u25c6 <strong>Use the Environment</strong> \u2013 Hideouts, alternate paths, distractions\u2026 Each mission offers multiple solutions.<br>\u25c6 <strong>Outsmart the Enemies\u2019 Sharp Senses</strong> \u2013 Keen vision, acute hearing, heightened smell\u2026 Discover a <strong>new way to play</strong> where infiltration is no longer just about hiding!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Lead the Untouchables</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503790/extras/25b70d2445b9eecba85d0bda226ae647.poster.avif?t=1773043697\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503790/extras/25b70d2445b9eecba85d0bda226ae647.webm?t=1773043697\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503790/extras/25b70d2445b9eecba85d0bda226ae647.mp4?t=1773043697\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the leader of the <strong>Untouchables</strong>, take control of <strong>Eliot Ness</strong> and his team, a group of specialists with complementary skills\u2014each playing a crucial role in your infiltration missions:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c6 <strong>Eliot Ness</strong> \u2013 A bold and adaptable leader, capable of handling any situation to complete even the most dangerous missions.<br>\u25c6 <strong>Malone B. Clonan</strong> \u2013 A tough and loyal right-hand man, favoring a more direct and forceful approach.<br>\u25c6 <strong>Frank E. Eager</strong> \u2013 A methodical and discreet sniper, eliminating targets with deadly precision.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Additional specialists will join your team to refine your strategies.<br>Learn to <strong>leverage their strengths and weaknesses</strong> to craft unique strategies and catch the underworld off guard.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Infiltrate Iconic Locations</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503790/extras/6902bb5186c3aabdd1f383069e6f2a00.poster.avif?t=1773043697\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503790/extras/6902bb5186c3aabdd1f383069e6f2a00.webm?t=1773043697\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503790/extras/6902bb5186c3aabdd1f383069e6f2a00.mp4?t=1773043697\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each mission takes you deep into <strong>Chicago\u2019s most crime-ridden</strong> and corrupt hotspots.<br>Observe, plan, and adapt your approach to achieve your objectives <strong>without leaving a trace</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From <strong>The Loop</strong>, Chicago\u2019s iconic district and center of corrupt power, to the <strong>mayor\u2019s residence</strong>, where criminal alliances are forged, and the <strong>foggy docks of Lake Michigan</strong>, a key smuggling hub\u2014each location is filled with dangers and opportunities, requiring <strong>tailored approaches to survive</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But other criminal strongholds await, where even the slightest mistake could be fatal.<br>Only the most strategic players will <strong>infiltrate undetected</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you be able to operate in the shadows and bring down <strong>Al Capone\u2019s criminal empire</strong>?</p>","developers":["SUPER AC"],"genres":[{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503790/dc9b4b24554f276600a69b6ab54e289c96437d95/header.jpg?t=1773043697","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"(c) SUPER AC 2025","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3503790/1175971422/2a2f7ed4786a5f7cd3e0da70593c383e3d37413d/1764347819/dash_av1.mpd?t=1764349960","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3503790/1175971422/2a2f7ed4786a5f7cd3e0da70593c383e3d37413d/1764347819/dash_h264.mpd?t=1764349960","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3503790/1175971422/2a2f7ed4786a5f7cd3e0da70593c383e3d37413d/1764347819/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1764349960","id":257239994,"name":"PROHIBEAST Gameplay Features","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257239994/c3474bd261c25e1b9c8e8e0b2ad7fca578205c08/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1764349960"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3503790/311574929/168ea60b551662aecf861e087f415364e9ea12de/1756895271/dash_av1.mpd?t=1756909135","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3503790/311574929/168ea60b551662aecf861e087f415364e9ea12de/1756895271/dash_h264.mpd?t=1756909135","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3503790/311574929/168ea60b551662aecf861e087f415364e9ea12de/1756895271/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1756909135","id":257192573,"name":"PROHIBEAST Story Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257192573/73c57abf018fce0c31ab8c8c11fb3d65f72b1f0c/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1756909135"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3503790/859936/aa4c6109452e0c094f4e9d59121d913b9eaa4229/1750856488/dash_av1.mpd?t=