6e364e.600x338.jpg?t=1773043697"}],"short_description":"Immerse yourself in a 1930s Chicago plagued by corruption and illegal meat trafficking. In this stealth-tactics game, control Eliot Ness and his team. Exploit the environment, deceive your enemies and strike the mafia from the shadows to dismantle Al Capone's criminal empire.","steam_appid":3503790,"support_info":{"email":"contact@superacgames.com","url":"superacgames.com"},"supported_languages":"English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Simplified Chinese, Spanish - Latin America, Polish, Portuguese - Brazil, Portuguese - Portugal, Russian","type":"game","website":"https://www.superacgames.com/produit/prohibeast/"}